{"id": "t070-002", "text": "yasmin's last day at the agency is friday, leaving drinks at the Crown after work", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "yasmin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day at the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks at the Crown", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after work", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t070-003", "text": "Chat w Alejandro after standup. His wife Petra is due in about six weeks, he's already shattered just thinking about it. Get a card from the team before he goes on paternity leave.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after standup"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in about six weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "shattered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get a card from the team", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t070-004", "text": "Freya said the client pitch for Banerjee & Co got moved to 3rd of June. She's presenting solo for the first time and is properly nervous. I should check in with her the day before and maybe do a dry run with her on the Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Freya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "client pitch for Banerjee & Co", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 3rd of June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "properly nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "do a dry run with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Monday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t070-005", "text": "Ava - allergic to sesame, don't order the poke place for the team lunch", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to sesame", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "don't order the poke place", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "team lunch", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t070-009", "text": "Nia's dad has a hip op on 22/10. She's taking the week off to look after him. Remind me to message her that evening to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-010", "text": "Francesca (Fran) from accounts loves anything matcha, mentioned it twice today. Her birthday's next Wednesday so that's an easy gift.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fran", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from accounts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "matcha", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t070-014", "text": "Rebecca Wright starts as head of client services on 1st November. Big deal for her. Congratulate her properly and invite her for lunch the week after she starts.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca Wright", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of client services", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1st November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Congratulate her properly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite her for lunch", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after she starts", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t070-015", "text": "Chen called. His mum's in hospital again, chest infection, they think she'll be in till at least Tuesday. He sounded wiped out. Ring him on the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chest infection", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till at least Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wiped out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-016", "text": "Kasia wants to come up and visit on the 8th and 9th of Nov, I'm doing the spare room this weekend", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 8th and 9th of Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend"}]}
{"id": "t070-017", "text": "Xavier's performance review is tomorrow, he's dreading it, says his manager has been on his back for weeks. text him after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Xavier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "performance review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "weeks"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-018", "text": "Met Julien for coffee. He's just finished his MBA, graduating 12 December, and his partner Anil is planning a surprise dinner for him the night after. I'm on dessert duty.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MBA", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduating", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night after", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t070-019", "text": "Ann's daughter got into Cambridge!! Ann was beaming, kept showing everyone the email. Her daughter wants to do medicine, starts in October next year, and Ann's already worrying about the cost of halls. Ann's husband is apparently planning a family dinner for it this Saturday. send flowers to the house before Saturday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Cambridge", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "beaming", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to do medicine", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October next year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worrying about the cost of halls", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "family dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to the house", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-021", "text": "Chantal mentioned she's been struggling since the restructure, her whole team got merged into Kemal's and nobody tells her anything. She said she's been sleeping badly and thinking about applying for the ops role in Manchester, but her partner doesn't want to move. Must take her for a proper coffee next week, not just a 5 min check in, and remind me to ask Kemal on Thursday whether there's room to give her back the supplier accounts.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chantal", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "restructure", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sleeping badly", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about applying for the ops role in Manchester", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't want to move", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her for a proper coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Kemal", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t070-022", "text": "Lila's band is playing the Lexington on 19 Nov. buy tix", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "band", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing the Lexington", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "19 Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy tix", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t070-023", "text": "Ximena is vegan and doesn't drink. Book the place on Hope Street for the client dinner, they do a decent menu.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Book the place on Hope Street", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "client dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t070-028", "text": "voice memo: right so Hiroshi is leaving the Tokyo office and coming to London permanently, start date is the 6th of January, he's bringing his wife and their two kids. Um he asked if I knew any decent schools near Clapham. I said I'd ask around. Remind me to send him the list from Petra on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving the Tokyo office", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to London", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 6th of January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him the list from Petra", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-031", "text": "Back from Petra and Alejandro's. Baby's sleeping through finally. Petra's mum is staying with them till mid November.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sleeping through", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with them", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till mid November", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t070-034", "text": "Ava had her interview with Kumar Partners on Tuesday. Waiting to hear back, they said by end of next week. Ask her Friday if she's heard anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview with Kumar Partners", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of next week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-035", "text": "Aoife's moving date got pushed to the 28th, Leon's already over there. she's coming to the leaving thing on the 21st though", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to the 28th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving thing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 21st", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t070-036", "text": "Yusuf and Nia are engaged!!! Found out at lunch. Wedding probably next summer, maybe in Nia's home town in Cardiff, and Yusuf's already panicking about the speech. Nia's mum is apparently thrilled and has been planning since about 2019. Chip in for the card going round, and don't forget to ask Nia on Monday if they've picked a date yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engaged", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "lunch"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably next summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "home town in Cardiff", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking about the speech", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since about 2019"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Chip in for the card going round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Nia", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t070-037", "text": "quick one - Francesca's mum passed away on Sunday. funeral is Thursday 23rd. Fran's off for the rest of the week. sign the card and send something from the team.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday 23rd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fran", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sign the card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something from the team", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t070-041", "text": "Had a long catch up with Rebecca after the quarterly review. She's been at the firm eleven years, thinking she might go part time next year to look after her dad, he was diagnosed with Parkinson's in the summer. She hasn't decided yet. She also said her son Oliver has his grade 5 piano exam on 17 November and he's been practising every night. She lives in Didsbury now, moved in August. Remind me to ask how the exam went the week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the quarterly review"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the firm eleven years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go part time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Parkinson's", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 5 piano exam", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Didsbury", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "in August", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the exam went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-045", "text": "Julien and Anil are off to Japan for three weeks over Christmas, leaving the 20th. Julien's mad about ramen, wants recs for Osaka", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks over Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ramen", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants recs for Osaka", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t070-046", "text": "Ann's retiring at the end of March after 30 years. The team's planning something for her last day, Khadija's organising. Ask Khadija on Monday what she needs from me.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after 30 years"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Khadija", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-047", "text": "Leon's starting at the hospital in Galway on Monday. ICU nurse. Text him Sunday night good luck", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting at the hospital in Galway", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "ICU nurse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-050", "text": "Ximena's flight back from Mexico City lands at 6am Tuesday. She's coming straight into the office for the board meeting, poor thing. Bring her a coffee.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight back from Mexico City", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6am Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "board meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring her a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t070-052", "text": "Felix's little girl Rosie has her nativity play on the 15th, she's a sheep apparently. He's taking the afternoon off for it and his wife's parents are driving down from Durham the night before. Felix said he's been up till midnight helping make the costume out of an old fleece. Remind me to ask him on the 16th how it went and to get a photo, the team will love it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nativity play", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down from Durham", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till midnight"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 16th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a photo", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t070-053", "text": "Jin found Mochi!! She was in the neighbour's shed the whole time. Jin's over the moon", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "found", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t070-055", "text": "Kemal Khan from procurement — call him back Wednesday re the Andersson contract, he wants the revised figures by Friday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal Khan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from procurement", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him back", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday"}]}
{"id": "t070-059", "text": "Elijah didn't get the promotion. He was pretty flat about it. Take him for a pint next week, don't make a thing of it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
